<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12916" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποκορῠφ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bring to a point,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.49.6
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>rise to a head,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ὀξύ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Prog.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			; <i>run to a point,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλὸξ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Ign.</u>
					53
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>culminate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς εἰς ἓν -κορυφοῦται ἡ νόησις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					213
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπεκορύφου σφι τάδε</span>
			<i>gave</i> them this <i>summary answer,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.73
			</span></i>; <i>cause to culminate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διδασκαλίαν εἰς θεολογίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simp.
					<u>in Ph.</u>
					1359.8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>in Cael.</u>
				126.3
			</span></i>.</div>
